# ACME TECHNOLOGIES — EMPLOYEE LEAVE & TIME OFF POLICY (2026)
## 1. Annual Paid Leave (Vacation)
- Entitlement: Full-time employees are entitled to 25 paid vacation days per calendar year.
- Accrual: Leave is accrued at the rate of 2.08 days per completed calendar month of service.
- Carry-Over: A maximum of 5 unused vacation days may be carried over into the following calendar year, provided they are utilized by March 31st.

## 2. Sick and Medical Leave
- Entitlement: Employees receive 10 paid sick days per calendar year.
- Documentation: Any sick leave extending beyond 3 consecutive working days requires a verified medical certificate signed by a licensed healthcare professional.
- Emergency Notification: Employees must notify their direct manager via Nexus before 09:00 AM on the day of absence.

## 3. Parental and Family Leave
- Maternity Leave: Eligible female employees are granted 26 weeks of fully paid maternity leave.
- Paternity Leave: New fathers and secondary caregivers receive 4 weeks of fully paid parental leave.

## 4. Public & Floating Holidays
- Acme Technologies observes 11 official public holidays annually.
- In addition, employees receive 2 floating holidays to observe cultural, religious, or personal events of significance.

## 5. Approval Hierarchy
1. Employee submits leave application via Nexus HR -> Leave.
2. Direct Department Manager reviews request within 48 business hours.
3. Upon approval, HR payroll records and attendance logs are automatically synchronized.
